<title>UK: UK clears Bank of Ireland's Bristol &amp; West bid.</title>
<headline>UK clears Bank of Ireland's Bristol &amp; West bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain said on Monday that it had cleared the acquisition of Bristol &amp; West Building Society by the Bank of Ireland and would not refer the deal to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
</text>
